---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import dealer from '../data/dealer.json';

const updatedDate = 'May 19, 2026';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Nakaja Bikes"
  description="Privacy policy for Nakaja Bikes, explaining how showroom, WhatsApp, Messenger, financing, and website inquiry data is handled."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="max-w-[1040px] mx-auto px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-primary-container mb-4">Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display font-black text-white uppercase mb-6">How Nakaja Handles Your Data</h1>
    <p class="text-secondary text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">When you contact Nakaja Bikes, we use your details to answer clearly, confirm motorcycle availability, support financing conversations, and help you plan a showroom visit.</p>
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mt-6">Last updated: {updatedDate}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-[1040px] mx-auto px-6 pb-24">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[0.35fr_1fr] gap-10 border-t border-metal/20 pt-10">
      <aside class="text-secondary font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">
        Nakaja Bikes<br />
        {dealer.location}
      </aside>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-collect-heading">
          <h2 id="privacy-collect-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We may collect your name, phone number, motorcycle model interest, message details, callback request, financing interest, and any information you send through the website, WhatsApp, Messenger, phone, email, or showroom visit.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">When you use Messenger or WhatsApp, Meta may send us channel identifiers, message content, delivery metadata, and related conversation details needed to respond and keep a basic chat record.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-use-heading">
          <h2 id="privacy-use-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">How We Use It</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Respond to your motorcycle, financing, service, or showroom inquiry.</li>
            <li>Confirm model availability, price guidance, deposits, and next steps.</li>
            <li>Route your request to Nakaja sales or support staff.</li>
            <li>Maintain lead and chat records for follow-up, service quality, and fraud prevention.</li>
            <li>Improve website forms, contact flows, and rider support.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-share-heading">
          <h2 id="privacy-share-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Who We Share It With</h2>
          <p>We use trusted service providers to run the website and contact flows, including Cloudflare, Supabase, Meta, and other tools needed for hosting, form handling, messaging, security, and analytics.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">If you ask about financing, we may share relevant inquiry details with financing partners so they can explain eligibility, deposit, repayment, and approval requirements. Financing approval remains subject to partner terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-retain-heading">
          <h2 id="privacy-retain-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Retention And Security</h2>
          <p>We keep inquiry and chat records only as long as needed for follow-up, support, operations, legal, security, or accounting reasons. We limit access to people and systems that need the data to serve you.</p>
        </section>

        <section aria-labelledby="privacy-rights-heading">
          <h2 id="privacy-rights-heading" class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-white uppercase mb-4">Your Choices</h2>
          <p>You can ask us to access, correct, or delete your inquiry data. Use the <a href="/data-deletion/" class="text-white underline decoration-primary-container underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary">data deletion page</a>, email <a href={`mailto:${dealer.email}`} class="text-white underline decoration-primary-container underline-offset-4 hover:text-primary">{dealer.email}</a>, or contact Nakaja on {dealer.phoneDisplay}.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
